B.a6m=new A.w(B.aaA,["Duration (seconds)","Distance (metres)","How to send to your watch","In the {name} app, go to Profile \u2192 Workout Library. Open this workout, tap Send to Device, and select your watch.","COROS needs a distance, duration, or explicitly open-ended step.","COROS accepts pace targets from 2:00 to 24:59 per km.","COROS rounds time and distance to whole seconds or metres.","The title was shortened to COROS\u2019s 100-character limit.","The workout instructions exceed the supported length.","COROS may already have saved this workout. Check the COROS library before exporting another copy.","Watch integrations","Export to watch","Choose which integration to use for future exports. You can change it in Watch integrations.","Your default destination is unavailable. Reconnect it or choose another in Watch integrations.","Workout steps","Repeat \xd7{count}","Connected","Disconnected","Default destination","The watch service is unavailable. Try again.","{name} authorization was declined.","The {name} sign-in expired. Connect again.","Approve access in {name}, then return here and choose Finish sign-in.","Finish sign-in","Return to the app or browser where you started and choose Finish sign-in under {name}.","Start over","Export to {name}","Save to {name}","Saved in {name}","Connect / sign in again","Disconnect","Close","Send to watch","Watch","Garmin session saved. It will be checked on the next request.","No app account needed. Your Garmin session is stored encrypted on the server. Clearing browser storage or switching devices can lose access to this connection.","Garmin email","Garmin password","Verification code","Enter the Garmin code within 5 minutes. One attempt; sign in again if it fails.","Verification expired or failed. Sign in again.","Request failed. Check the connection and try again. Retrying a saved operation will not create another workout.","Garmin export is not configured in this build.","Garmin may have received this request. Check Garmin Connect for the workout or delivery status.","Please reconnect to Garmin, then retry this operation.","Too many requests. Wait before trying again.","Another Garmin operation is running. Try again shortly.","Cannot save or read the export history. No new request will be sent until local storage works.","Copy workout link","No compatible running watch found. The workout is still saved in Garmin Connect.","Delivery requested. Sync your watch with Garmin Connect.","Optional block","Include","Exclude","Choose a value within the range (whole laps).","Using maximum repetitions; skipping depends on your watch","Unspecified lap length: using 400 m.","Cannot export this end condition","Cannot export conflicting or invalid pace targets. Check VMA and the source plan.","Some targets are included as instructions only, without watch alerts.","A title or description was shortened to Garmin\u2019s limit.","There are no exportable steps.","This workout exceeds the supported limit of 200 steps.","Retry","Send error report","Error report sent.","Could not send the error report. Try again.","Unable to load this workout. Try refreshing.","Session","laps","repetitions","End on instruction","Endpoint not specified","or","and","% max HR","steps/min","within this effort","across repetitions","linear progression","progression pattern unspecified","Active recovery","Passive recovery","Movement unspecified","run","jog","walk","stand","sit","other movement","Interpretation details","Note","Clarification","reviewer","source","No work prescribed for this phase","Not specified in the source","Optional","between repetitions only","Effort","Recovery","Drill","Stated time budget","Repeat","Choose one alternative","Reset custom rows","Calculator","Choose four measures to display. Enter two independent values; tap a calculated value to replace an input.","Type","Input","Calculated","Tap to replace an input","Known value 1","Known value 2","Distance (km)","Time (h:mm:ss)","Pace (min:sec/km)","Intensity (% VMA)","Results","Enter two valid values for different quantities to calculate the others.","Use mm:ss or h:mm:ss for time, min:sec for pace. A bare number means seconds.","Decimals can use a dot or comma.","Set your VMA to calculate intensity.","Enter a valid positive value.","No VMA saved yet","Enter your VMA to see pace targets.","VMA: {value} km/h","Set VMA","Update VMA","Intensity","Pace (min/km)","Speed (km/h)","Distance","Time (m:s)","Avg pace","Times","Intensity","Workout","Messages","Challenge","Settings","Team race challenge","Club communications","Enter the club password to decrypt these messages.","Password hint","Password","Shared password","Unlock messages","The password only lives on your device; nothing is stored.","Incorrect password or the bundle is corrupted.","Error loading communications","Couldn't reach server, showing cached communications.","Offline mode: showing bundled communications instead.","App version","Language","System default","English","French","Dutch","Theme","Dark","Light","Time range","More settings coming soon.","Adjust intensity range","Min %","Max %","Step %","Use numbers only.","Values must be greater than 0.","Min must be less than Max.","Step is too large for the range.","Distance range","Min (m)","Max (m)","Enter your VMA","Whole number","Hundredths","Minimum","Maximum","VMA (e.g. 17.15)","Please enter a number","Save","Cancel","Set target distance","Distance (meters)","Enter a distance greater than 0.","Half marathon","Marathon","m","meters","km","kilometers","Group 1","Group 2","Before session","Warm-up","Session content","Cool down","Notes","Recovery","active","walk","jog","rest","Export","Plan copied to clipboard","Export to Clipboard","Refresh content","Couldn't reach server, showing cached plan.","Offline mode: showing bundled training plan instead.","Couldn't reach server, showing cached challenge.","Offline mode: showing bundled challenge table instead.","No data available"],t.w)
